{"id": "69113", "title": "二婚不昏", "author": "夏末秋", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69113.htm", "intro": "人家是闪婚闪离，她是闪离闪婚。\r\n头婚新婚当天成弃妇，三天后拿到离婚协议；\r\n二婚更奇葩，见面三次就被拉去领了小红本……\r\n肖梓涵：“我不爱你，你为什么娶我？”\r\n钟帅““因为你不爱我！”\r\n感情这帅哥不至情商低，智商更低啊！\r\n二婚的女人还会幸福吗？谁知道呢,反正她不爱他！\r\n\r\n内容标签：婚恋 军旅 高干 都市情缘", "base": "files/article/html/69/69113", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10558466.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10558467.html", "available": true}, {"title": "3", "file": "10558468.html", "available": true}, {"title": "4", "file": "10558469.html", "available": true}, {"title": "5", "file": "10558470.html", "available": true}, {"title": "6", "file": "10558471.html", "available": true}, {"title": "7", "file": "10558472.html", "available": true}, {"title": "8", "file": "10558473.html", "available": true}, {"title": "9", "file": "10558474.html", "available": true}, {"title": "10", "file": "10558475.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11", "file": "10558476.html", "available": true}, {"title": "12", "file": "10558477.html", "available": true}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10558478.html", "available": true}]}